@@ reply
```mermaid
mindmap
  root((IPC))
    Message passing
      The kernel copies the data
      pipe
        one-way byte stream
      socket
        two-way, also across machines
      message queue
        whole messages
    Shared memory
      No copy
      Needs a semaphore or a mutex
    Signal
      Notification only
```

The first two branches are the real choice: the kernel copies for you, or you share pages and synchronise access yourself.
